{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13221140.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322114001:1":{"text":"カレリーナさん、今日、修道院でカタストロフ事件の犠牲者たちのお葬式を行うと、町民たちが言っていました。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，我听镇民们说，修道院今天就要为这次恶魔事件的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB310AD3FE00909D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322114002:1":{"text":"今から<style=\"highlight\">ホワイトマウンテン修道院</style>へ行けば鎮魂の儀式に間に合いますよ。","source_cn":"如果要为逝者祈祷的话，现在去<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD43FBACC09428374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322114003:1":{"text":"ロンロンたちも一緒に行きますよ。騎士は一度約束したことは必ず守りますから！","source_cn":"我们会陪你一起去的！满满身为骑士，答应过的事情就一定要做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8306D926E431D46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322114004:1":{"text":"ありがとうございます。ですが、グレイヴボーンである私は隠し通路を使わなければなりません。それに大聖堂の中には入れません。","source_cn":"谢谢你们。但我身为亡灵，只能从密道悄悄过去，也无法进入...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AC1D7BDBBD0085C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322114005:1":{"text":"よろしければ、修道院の裏にある墓地でお会いしましょう。","source_cn":"如果你们不介意的话，我们就在修道院后面的墓地见面吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B8C75C4D8F0BA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"カレリーナ","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13221180.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322118001:1":{"text":"私のせいで……彼らを怖がらせてしまった……","source_cn":"是我的错……我吓到他们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA7D62753DA2BB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322118002:1":{"text":"どうしましょう……ただでさえ大変な時期なのに、今のでさらに不安がらせてしまったら……","source_cn":"最近发生了太多事，我很担心，或许刚才发生的一切会让他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA858C18B392223D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322118003:1":{"text":"あなたのせいじゃないですよ、カレリーナさん。この国のグレイヴボーンが生まれたわけを、皆さんが知っていれば……","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，这也不能怪你啦。唉，要是大家都知道白山亡灵诞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43BA46CF28E2E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322118004:1":{"text":"でも二千年も前から、ここの人たちはグレイヴボーンを悪の象徴だと思っているわ。たとえ真相を知ったとしても、長年の認識を変えるのは簡単じゃないと思う……","source_cn":"可是两千年以来，这里的人们都觉得亡灵是邪恶的象征。这种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6280ADBBEB26D343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322118005:1":{"text":"私は……自分が行動することで、人々のグレイヴボーンに対する見方が変わればいいと思っていたのですが……","source_cn":"我……我的本意是希望用行动改变人们对亡灵的看法，但没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98ECE24BF71D995","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322118006:1":{"text":"彼らに、謝らないとですね……","source_cn":"我应该向他们道歉才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6E895662BF55C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1322118006":{"text":"彼らに、謝らないとですね……","source_cn":"我应该向他们道歉才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6E895662BF55C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322118007:1":{"text":"そうですね……私は聖職者の皆様とは会わない方がいいでしょう。","source_cn":"你说得对……我应该先避开这里的圣职者们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD5508C4A76B7B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322118008:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、どうか私の代わりに、驚かせてしまった方たちに謝っていただけますか？","source_cn":"<style=stress