atched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CE34C3062DB0F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322121013:1":{"text":"ロンロンたちは皆さんに謝りに……って、違う違う！さっきのグレイヴボーンの女性の代わりに、皆さんに謝りに来たんです。","source_cn":"其实，我们是来向你们道歉的……不对不对，是替刚才那位亡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB3E7EEB12035A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1322121013":{"text":"ロンロンたちは皆さんに謝りに……って、違う違う！さっきのグレイヴボーンの女性の代わりに、皆さんに謝りに来たんです。","source_cn":"其实，我们是来向你们道歉的……不对不对，是替刚才那位亡灵女士来向你们道歉的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB3E7EEB12035A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322121014:1":{"text":"信徒ですって！？グレイヴボーンが？あり得ません！","source_cn":"虔诚信徒？亡灵？！这不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78896BFE32276A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322121016:1":{"text":"嘘じゃないですよ！ラジノフ家のカレリーナさんは知っているでしょう？","source_cn":"我们才不会骗你呢！你应该知道拉季诺夫家族的卡列琳娜女士吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12965454A4B9384E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322121017:1":{"text":"ラジノフ……どこかで聞いたことがあるような……待ってください、カレリーナさんは亡くなっているはずでは？修道院の墓地で彼女のお墓を見たことがありますよ！","source_cn"