30","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322123001:1":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方は……どうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322123001":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方は……どうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322123002:1":{"text":"分かりました……私のために色々してくださったのに。申し訳ありません……","source_cn":"我明白了。很抱歉，让你们为我做了这么多事情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D71381609CACF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322123003:1":{"text":"分かっていたのです……今の状況では、この国の人たちに私たちを信用してもらうのは無理だと……","source_cn":"其实我知道，依照现在的情形，白山的民众不可能彻底信任我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A37F1225A0AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322123004:1":{"text":"たとえ教会が生きた屍を認めても、彼らがかつては栄えある戦士だっとことを皆が知っても……屍が人々を襲う限り、彼らに対する恐怖は消えません。","source_cn":"哪怕教会认可活死人的身份，哪怕人人都知道他们曾是光荣的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847A7A7392EA2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322123005:1":{"text":"人々は結局私たちを恐れ、遠ざける……下手をすれば教会の心遣いまで疑われかねません。","source_cn":"到最后，人们还是会害怕我们，远离我们，甚至还会质疑教会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F55D3492BFD7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322123006:1":{"text":"それは、私が望んだ結果ではありません……","source_cn":"我……不想让事情变成这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2121C0D9D0002662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322123007:1":{"text":"やっぱり、生きた屍が人々を襲わない方法を見つけないといけませんね……","source_cn":"看来还是得找到让活死人不再攻击人类的方法才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E29977B0B65C8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322123008:1":{"text":"はい。それをずっと考えていたのですが、彼らに真の安らぎを与えるには、やはり聖堂の方たちと協力する必要があると思います。","source_cn":"是的。这个问题我反复思考了很久，我认为想要让他们彻底安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0A805B1BF7F119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322123009:1":{"text":"え？どうしてです？","source_cn":"咦？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA8E7BF8077E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322123010:1":{"text":"聖光は強い浄化の力を持ちます。私たちのような亡者にはあまり効果はありませんが、理性を失い、本能のみで動く「生きた屍」には、とても有効的です。","source_cn":"圣光对亡灵有着很强的净化作用。虽然在我们这样的亡灵身上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4221441E280872BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322123011:1":{"text":"ですが、修道者さんたちはグレイヴボーンを信用していないのですよ。そんな彼らがカレリーナさんに協力するでしょうか……うう、これじゃあ八方塞がりです……！","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1322123011":{"text":"ですが、修道者さんたちはグレイヴボーンを信用していないのですよ。そんな彼らがカレリーナさんに協力するでしょうか……うう、これじゃあ八方塞がりです……！","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳娜合作……啊啊啊，糟糕，这简直就是一个打不开的死结嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322123012:1":{"text":"修道院の皆様に私の誠意を示せるよう努力します……ですが、今はまだ時期尚早かもしれません。","source_cn":"我会向修道院的圣职者展现出我的虔诚和诚意。但……或许不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897E4C172BDEA1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322123014:1":{"text":"葬儀で騒ぎを起こしてしまったせいで、皆様不安がっているでしょうから……今はこの話をしない方がいいかもしれません。私も、暫くは修道院に行くのは控えます。","source_cn":"葬礼上的意外已经引起了修士和修女的恐慌……现在还是不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D81844227A0AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322123015:1":{"text":"その間、一族の蔵書を調べてみます。もしかしたら、生きた屍の問題を解決する糸口が掴めるかもしれません。","source_cn":"这段时间我会翻翻家族的藏书，或许能从古籍里找到解决活死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8280F37F860987BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"他の方法を考えよう。","source_cn":"想想别的办法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBCFDD244422EB2C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"他の方法を考えよう。","female":"他の方法を考えましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"69472","variant_female_record_index":"69473","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322123013:1":{"text":"今からですか？それはまだ早いかと……","source_cn":"现在就去？恐怕不太合适。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC61E9C2AF6A2257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"もう一度修道院の人たちと話してみよう。","source_cn":"再去修道院和他们聊聊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x09E7F5EBA7594340","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もう一度修道院の人たちと話してみよう。","female":"もう一度修道院の人たちと話してみましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"69474","variant_female_record_index":"69475","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"（返事をしない）","source_cn":"（沉默不语）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6FA44F823490C7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（返事をしない）","female":"（返事をしない）","variant_male_record_index":"87523","variant_female_record_index":"87524","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"あまりよくないかも……","source_cn":"不是很好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B288A9FFD371B21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あまりよくないかも……","female":"あまりよくないかも……","variant_male_record_index":"69470","variant_female_record_index":"69471","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"カレリーナ","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/timeline/quest_story/13221160.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13221160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115001:":{"text":"女神様……","source_cn":"女神啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B1000F3820762C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115002:":{"text":"どうか、彼らに永遠の安らぎを。","source_cn":"请赐下永恒的安息","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A2B4FC526464571","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115003:":{"text":"死者の魂に――","source_cn":"让所有逝者的灵魂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADD2919254AD538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115004:":{"text":"祝福と安寧を与えたまえ……","source_cn":"得到祝福与安宁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED7930FEE3B29DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322116001:1":{"text":"な、何の音です？……そこにいるのは誰ですか！？","source_cn":"奇怪，什么声音……谁！谁在那里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169F8DB279AF7A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322116002:1":{"text":"あなたは……葬儀に参列される方ですか？なぜ突然墓地の裏から……？先ほど見回りしたときは誰もいなかったはず……","source_cn":"咦，这位女士，你是来参加葬礼仪式的吗？为什么会突然从墓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099580131DD0877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322116003:1":{"text":"私は……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842BD49F1E0099A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322116004:1":{"text":"ま、待てください……その顔色……まるで生きた屍のように白い――ま、まさか、人間じゃない！？","source_cn":"等等……你、你的脸色……苍白得和活死人一样！你——你不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB57ECA6982AAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322116005:1":{"text":"な！？生きた屍！？は、早く彼女を止めて！みんなが危ない！","source_cn":"什么，活死人？！快……快拦住她，不要让她伤害这里的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91BA7DFFB4521AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322116006:1":{"text":"警告、脅威を発見！","source_cn":"警告，发现威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F2AD780DD859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322116007:1":{"text":"カーシャを、守る。脅威、排除！","source_cn":"必须清除！保护，小卡莎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39A0F780DA8B9F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322116008:1":{"text":"な、何ですかあれは！？あ、あなたたち、一体何をするつもりです！？ああ、デューラ様！","source_cn":"艾雅啊！这……这是什么东西……你……你们要干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17B4705845241F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322116009:1":{"text":"やめてください、お兄様！彼らを傷つけてはだめです！","source_cn":"铐兰哥哥，快住手！不要伤害他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2598C0ABE18D8C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322116010:1":{"text":"カタストロフ……カタストロフの眷族です！皆さん、早く逃げてください！","source_cn":"恶魔……他们肯定是恶魔的眷属！大家快跑、快跑啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8107B616D3B01F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117001:":{"text":"カタストロフの眷族です！早く逃げて！","source_cn":"恶魔眷属来了！快跑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA12F5891F420E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117002:":{"text":"に、逃げろ！カタストロフだ！","source_cn":"快跑！恶魔出现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CC81DFC50FA0AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117003:":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様、どうか我々をお救いください！","source_cn":"艾雅在上，救救我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1FF4AEF6028917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:13050313:0":{"text":"カレリーナを守ろうと現れたゴーランを見て、怖がった人々が逃げ出した。","source_cn":"铐兰出现保护卡列琳娜，却意外吓跑了所有的民众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1865D919CA834B66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:13050312:0":{"text":"人々が死者のために祈っていると、二人の修道者が同じく祈りに来たカレリーナに気づいた。","source_cn":"众人正为亡者祈祷时，两位修士发现了前来祈祷的卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AC1C15A21BDB07","variant_status":"","mal